+## Context
+
+`priceOrder` computes the coupon from the gross total; `Coupons.redeemable` rejects when the date is on or after `validUntil`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Compute the coupon on the sum of the lines after volume discounts. The 50% cap still applies to gross, as the README states.
+- Reject only when the date is strictly after `validUntil`.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-11-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-11-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md
