@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## Why
+
+Finance reports orders combining a volume discount with a percentage coupon get too much off (12 notebooks at €5.00 with a 10% coupon: €48.00 instead of €48.60). A customer's coupon valid until 30 November was refused as expired on 30 November. Both contradict the README business rules.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A percentage coupon is applied to the subtotal after volume discounts, not to the gross amount.
+- A coupon is accepted on its last valid day (the validity period includes both days).
+- Out of scope: VAT on shipping. A customer asked to remove it, but the README rule says shipping is subject to 22% VAT; that is a business/tax decision for the owner, so it is left unchanged.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `coupons`: coupon validity period and the base a coupon discount is computed on.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/pricing.ts`: coupon base. `src/coupons.ts`: expiry comparison. Tests added.
